@startuml
skinparam monochrome true

participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "Service" as Service
participant "Repository" as Repo
participant "DbContext" as DB
database "Database" as DataStore

== GetAll Request ==

Controller -> Service : GetAllAsync()
activate Service

Service -> Repo : GetAllAsync()
activate Repo

Repo -> DB : Entities\n.Include(e => e.Children)\n.Include(e => e.OtherRelations)\n.AsNoTracking()\n.ToListAsync()
activate DB

note right of DB
  AsNoTracking():
  - Read-only query
  - Better performance
  - No change tracking overhead
end note

DB -> DataStore : SELECT e.*, c.*, o.*\nFROM Entities e\nLEFT JOIN Children c ON ...\nLEFT JOIN OtherRelations o ON ...
activate DataStore
DataStore --> DB : Result set
deactivate DataStore

DB -> DB : Materialize entities
DB --> Repo : List<Entity>
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service : entities
deactivate Repo

== Map to DTOs ==

loop For each entity
    Service -> Service : MapToDto(entity)
    note right
      Extract:
      - Entity ID
      - Value Object values
      - Child entity data
      - Computed properties
    end note
end

Service --> Controller : List<ResponseDto>
deactivate Service

Controller --> Controller : 200 OK + List<ResponseDto>

note over Controller, DataStore
  **Query Patterns:**

  **GetAll:**
  - Load all entities
  - Include related data
  - AsNoTracking for performance

  **GetById:**
  - Single entity lookup
  - Include navigations
  - Return null if not found

  **GetByFilter:**
  - Where clause
  - Pagination support
  - Sorting support
end note

@enduml